# Development-only live tool/LLM Joint profile.
#
# Offered concurrency is 24 while vLLM max-num-seqs is 32, so the sequence
# ceiling cannot form the queue.  The smaller native per-iteration token
# budget is the intended LLM-side pressure source.  The physical-KV branch is
# dynamic and may admit anywhere up to the native ceiling; it does not install
# a fixed running target below offered load.

